-- say-language: 1
-- The film's say program: the studio's own welcome counter, verbatim
-- from the say-codegen fixture and the studio's docs (06-say.md). The
-- film types this into the real editor and presses the real Render —
-- say-codegen → counter.rs → studio rustc → cdylib → dlopen → preview.

keep a whole number called count starting at 0

screen "Home":
    a column, spaced 16, children aligned to the start:
        a heading "Counter"
        a label "Tapped \(count) times"
        a button "Add one" which when tapped:
            add 1 to count
